            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Do you have any jobs for me?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Do you have any jobs for me?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Well we always need to rotate the crops we're growing to stop the soil from tiring due to lack of nutrients. It would be great if you could help out with that."
              },
              {
                "player": "What would I need to do?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "If you're interested, I can give you a farming contract which tells you what to plant within the guild. Complete the contract, and I'll give you some seeds as a thank you."
